It would be awesome to have pet luggage.  Presumably you'd be able to #loot 
your pet luggage and put lots of stuff in it.  Then you can ascend with all 
your gems and gold and artifacts.  Hrm, are there such things as saddle-
bags in nethack?

Seriously though, it might be a bit too powerful because it's like 
polymorph, except you basically get to pick what stuff polymorphs into.  
Probably better if stuff turns into whatever it looks like the *following* 
turn.  Perhaps it could be counter-balanced by having everything in your 
inventory polymorph too.  It would be one of the few times (the only time?) 
that dropping stuff or stashing it in bags won't help.

